# Super-Soldier Serum on Bot1's Ornithopter (0/2 flying Thopter): +2/+2, first strike and vigilance, and a legendary Soldier in
# addition to its other types (Thopter stays); the Skullclamp (+1/-1) cast beside it is not attached to anything. On turn 3 Bot1 casts Lightning
# Greaves and attacks: "whenever enchanted creature attacks", both Equipment are chosen as targets ("any number") and
# attached, so the Ornithopter is 3/3 (0 + 2 + 1, 2 + 2 - 1) with haste and shroud too; it deals 3 first-strike damage
# (Bot2 17) and, having vigilance, is still untapped.

